@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:go to Amazon homepage;
:search for a book;
:click 22 used link to view available used books;
:click Add to Cart button for the second book;
:click Proceed to Checkout button;
:enter email address and select I am a new customer;
:click Sign in using our secure server button;
:enter customer details and click Create account;
:enter shipping details and click Continue;
:select shipping options and click Continue;
:choose payment method and enter credit card details;
:click Add your card;
:click Continue;
:choose billing address and select use the chosen address;
:click Place your order in AUD;
stop
@enduml